"geomgr (N7c, 2026-09-24): the BodyTwin geometry manager as ONE service (N7a core + N7b operations + BT-B35\noutlier test + BT-N5 certificate v2 + BT-B30 measured landmark noise + BT-B42/K5 CCD-AV definition + moment arms).\n\nAPI (numpy/scipy unless noted \"local\"):\n  gm  = api.GeometryManager(data_dir, exclude_vsd=None, kappa=None)   population in correspondence, versioned\n                                                                     registry (216 ids: landmarks, attachments,\n                                                                     tissue regions, footprints, wrap constructs,\n                                                                     3 wrap cylinders, TLEM knee/patella constructs)\n  res = gm.instantiate(features, feature_units, landmarks, subject, scenario)   conditioning + per-vertex/point\n                                                                     covariance (kappa-calibrated) + certificate\n  gm.landmark_outlier_test(landmarks)  /  ops.op_outlier              BT-B35 leave-one-landmark-out chi2 test\n  noise.scale_C(..., n_raters, n_trials)                              C_lm for averaged landmarks (BT-B30)\n  measures.ccd_av(L, V, F)                                            CCD/AV, chosen definition MEASURE_VERSION\n  ops.op_edit_osteotomy(inst, 'AV'|'CCD'|'L_mech', delta)             (b) edit, others held, certificate v2\n  ops.op_tissue(inst, thickness_mm)                                   (e) cortical/cartilage fields + layer shell\n  ops.op_register_surface(gm, dense, normals)                         (c) surface -> correspondence\n  inst.values()[<id>]                                                 any id incl. femur_r/wrap/<Cyl> (h, O2)\n  leg.moment_arms(values, leg, V) / leg.arm_band(gm, res, leg, n)     moment arms through the individual's own\n                                                                     femur + wrap cylinders, posterior band\n  identity.op_rigid/op_units/op_mirror/op_subdivide/op_retopologize   id-preserving operations; check_identity\n  certify2.certificate_v2 / instance_certificate                      v2 gates (BodyTwin v1 = local)\n  pipeline.numeric(subject) / pipeline.local(subject)                 the whole chain, timed per step\nCLI: python3 -m geomgr pipeline --subject z001 | --subjects demo10 [--stage numeric|local|all]\nResults and numbers: results/N7c/README.md, summary.json."
__version__ = '0.2.0'
